   "source": [
    "**Reading the result:** `z` is just a number — it can be any real value, positive or negative,\n",
    "large or small, depending on the inputs, weights, and bias. The activation function is what turns that raw\n",
    "number into something more useful — here, a value between 0 and 1 that could be interpreted as \"how\n",
    "confident is this one neuron that its inputs indicate the positive class?\"\n"
   ]
